@startuml 02-经营与用工域
' 民生甄选 · 业务用例图 L1 · 经营与用工域（UC-BIZ-09 ~ UC-BIZ-15）
title 民生甄选 · 业务用例图 · 经营与用工域
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "从业人员" as WORKER

rectangle "经营与用工域（业务目标）" {
  usecase "UC-BIZ-09 合规入驻经营" as B09
  usecase "UC-BIZ-10 透明公示响应维权" as B10
  usecase "UC-BIZ-11 诚信获客" as B11
  usecase "UC-BIZ-12 合规用工招工" as B12
  usecase "UC-BIZ-13 证明自我能力" as B13
  usecase "UC-BIZ-14 获得劳动报酬" as B14
  usecase "UC-BIZ-15 找好工作" as B15
}

MERCHANT --> B09
MERCHANT --> B10
MERCHANT --> B11
MERCHANT --> B12
WORKER --> B12
WORKER --> B13
WORKER --> B14
WORKER --> B15

note bottom of B11
  消费者以「群众点评」参与诚信生态（31 §2.6 E-02），为次要参与者
end note
@enduml
